## Architecture layers

```
src/
  core/
    domain/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/     # Entities + repository interfaces
    use_cases/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/  # Application use cases
  adapters/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/     # Flask Blueprint + repository impl
```

- **core/domain/** — Pure Python, no framework dependencies.
- **core/use_cases/** — Application logic depending only on domain interfaces.
- **adapters/** — Flask blueprints and SQLAlchemy repository implementations.

